  "schema:name": "Facility and provider scorecards with actionable insights",
  "schema:description": "This outcome presents standardized performance metrics, benchmarks, and quality indicators for healthcare institutions and professionals. It provides actionable insights to support performance improvement initiatives.\r\n\r\nThe purpose is to promote accountability, transparency, and continuous improvement in healthcare delivery. They also help organizations identify strengths, gaps, and priority improvement areas.\r\n\r\nExample: A regional health office compares vaccination coverage rates across healthcare facilities using provider scorecards.",
